.DS_Store
.claude/skills/
# No trailing slash, unlike every other directory entry here, and not a slip:
# a pattern ending in `/` matches a directory and nothing else. A worktree has
# no modules of its own, so `node_modules` gets symlinked in for the git hooks
# to run at all — and a symlink is not a directory, so the slashed form left it
# untracked-but-visible, one `git add -A` away from being committed.
node_modules
dist/
.claude/settings.local.json
.env*
!.env.example

# Hero images the ingest mirrors; the job writes them, no build does
icons/

# The bundle the export publishes; the job writes it, no build does
snapshot/

# Playwright run output
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/

# Stryker's sandbox (a full copy of the working tree) and its reports
.stryker-tmp/
reports/

# Private product specs in a public repo
spec-inbox/*
!spec-inbox/README.md
